 This is <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Proposition 2.1.4</span>, <a href="/bibliography/six-I">six-I</a>]</span> with slightly changed hypotheses; it is the analogue of <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Proposition 3.13</span>, <a href="/bibliography/Spaltenstein">Spaltenstein</a>]</span> for sites. 